        "(B) The directors have a similar process.",
        "The author writes about these two different movies within the same article to highlight the similarities in the directors' working methods.",
        "Both Mike Leigh and Errol Morris rarely begin a project with a clear idea of what they want it to be, and sometimes they don't end a project with a clear idea either.",
